=== LIVE PREPARATION / LIMITS (NOT EXECUTED) ===
Live requires explicit five-host measured inventory, frozen CandidateRevision matching local/remote HEAD, matching remote D21 scripts and already running backend+PG containers with persistent volumes.
Authenticated Windows PowerShell remoting must already be configured; no automatic TrustedHosts/WinRM/firewall setup and no credential logging.
Stop/restart reuse D21 -ContainerName, supporting D25 backend service names. Kill phase means stop with1-second grace, not physical laptop power loss.
Per-run firewall group blocks cross-side TCP9200 only (inbound local port, outbound remote port), never client9100/PG/management ports. Mesh is probed from backend containers; actual12 blocked/8 open and five client endpoints required or runner fails.
Recovery journals target before mutation, attempts all relevant heals/restarts/log collectors independently, verifies PG volume identity and does not delete volumes/reset DB. Controller hard crash/remote loss may require manual recovery of the per-run firewall group; do not claim G6 recovery from fake tests.
Live implementation path is prepared but NOT validated against five remote hosts. New TCP mesh probes and NODE_STATUS alone do not certify Raft traffic isolation, business commit/apply or SQL catch-up; full real acceptance belongs to the group G6 gate.
